title: '[DEFERRED] delivery/read receipts + send --wait[=accepted|delivered|read] (privacy-preserving, opt-in both sides)'
---
Track delivery state advance queued -> accepted -> delivered -> read. Add c2c send --wait[=state] --timeout. Read receipts via a signed consume-ack event. Load-bearing privacy rule: declining to emit a read MUST be indistinguishable from not-yet-read; opt-in both sides; default off; unknown/blocked peers never receive reads. DEFERRED: depends on a push transport plus server-side cursors that do not exist yet (polling is canonical for now). Max confirmed defer impl, 2026-07-07. Privacy model is designed; save for later.